# #186: at a full bar, A + Special (A + X in this script preset and Tom's layout, A + B in Melee's)
# is still the ultimate (special 17), never an EX special, now that Strong + Special is the EX.
# The match starts at an empty bar, so the setup fills it.
#! chat -dev setup quick hero thrall;meter 100
60 a tap A 2
60 a tap X 2
#! expect a 60-63 special 17
#! absent a 55-300 special EX
300 a capture
340 a press VIEW
410 a release VIEW
